      "writtenOn": "2023-08-31T13:30:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure about the approach here. On one hand I don\u0027t like adding data we\u0027re not going to use in non-test builds, on the other I\u0027m not sure where else to put it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 224,
        "startChar": 4,
